repository-code: "https://github.com/agourakis82/darwin-atlas"
url: "https://github.com/agourakis82/darwin-atlas"
abstract: >-
  A fail-closed development contract for testing DOSA as a reusable
  bacterial-window reversal and reverse-complement calibration resource under
  an exact fixed-endpoint dinucleotide null. Sounio is the canonical producer
  and Julia is an independent artifact validator. Gate U0 has not passed and
  this tree is not a public v3 atlas.
keywords:
